Package: tisca
Type: Package
Title: Test-Informed Simulation Count Algorithm v2
Version: 2.0.0-dev
Authors@R: person("H. G.", "Souto", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "hugo.souto@example.org")
Description: R reference implementation of the TISCA v2 two-layer
    simulation-design protocol (paired two-stage design with precision and
    power targets, multiplicity-aware planning, and model-confidence-set
    family inference). R twin of the Python reference; kept in numeric parity
    via the parity test suite in tisca/tests/ (P2-T2).
